#: backend/apps/ai/agents/advisor.py
msgid ""
"Writes the weekly and monthly business reviews; answers questions any time"
msgstr ""
"Haftalik va oylik biznes sharhlarini yozadi; savollarga istalgan vaqtda javob"
" beradi"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/advisor.py
msgid "Weekly business review"
msgstr "Haftalik biznes sharhi"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/advisor.py
msgid "Monthly business review"
msgstr "Oylik biznes sharhi"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/advisor.py
#, python-format
msgid "Reviews written so far: %(count)s"
msgid_plural "Reviews written so far: %(count)s"
msgstr[0] "Hozirgacha yozilgan sharhlar: %(count)s"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/advisor.py
msgid "There is no business review yet: the first one comes on Monday morning."
msgstr "Hozircha biznes sharhi yo‘q: birinchisi dushanba ertalab keladi."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/advisor.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"One more pharmacy that costs about %(cost)s a month to run: the lowest "
"balance would be %(low)s (%(date)s)."
msgstr ""
"Yuritish uchun oyiga taxminan %(cost)s ketadigan yana bitta dorixona: eng "
"past qoldiq %(low)s bo‘lardi (%(date)s)."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/advisor.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"On %(date)s the money would run out: not yet, or only with a loan or a "
"partner."
msgstr ""
"Pul tugab qoladigan kun: %(date)s. Hozircha emas, yoki faqat kredit yoki "
"sherik bilan."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/advisor.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Even then the money lasts the next %(days)s day: it fits, as long as the new "
"pharmacy starts selling soon."
msgid_plural ""
"Even then the money lasts the next %(days)s days: it fits, as long as the new"
" pharmacy starts selling soon."
msgstr[0] ""
"Shunda ham pul keyingi %(days)s kunga yetadi: yangi dorixona tez orada "
"sotuvni boshlasa, imkon bor."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/advisor.py
msgid "Advisor"
msgstr "Maslahatchi"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/advisor.py
msgid ""
"Your business advisor: every Monday morning the weekly review of the business"
" (what went well, what went wrong and three concrete suggestions, each tied "
"to a number), the monthly one on the first, and answers about the business "
"any time: can I afford a second pharmacy, where is my money going."
msgstr ""
"Biznes maslahatchingiz: har dushanba ertalab biznesning haftalik sharhi (nima"
" yaxshi, nima yomon bo‘ldi va har biri aniq raqamga tayangan uchta amaliy "
"taklif), har oyning birinchi kunida oylik sharh, hamda istalgan vaqtda biznes"
" haqidagi savollarga javob: ikkinchi dorixonaga pulim yetadimi, pulim qayerga"
" ketyapti."

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/advisor.py
msgid "The business review"
msgstr "Biznes sharhi"

#: backend/apps/ai/agents/advisor.py
msgid "Ask the advisor"
msgstr "Maslahatchidan so‘rang"

