"ko‘rsatkichlar."

#: backend/apps/tasks/api.py
msgid "Give from and to as YYYY-MM-DD."
msgstr ""
"Boshlanish (from) va tugash (to) sanalarini YYYY-MM-DD ko‘rinishida kiriting."

#: backend/apps/tasks/api.py
msgid "Pick up to 42 days, the last after the first."
msgstr ""
"Ko‘pi bilan 42 kunlik davr tanlang, oxirgi kun birinchi kundan oldin "
"bo‘lmasin."

#: backend/apps/tasks/api.py
msgid "That checklist item doesn't exist."
msgstr "Nazorat ro‘yxatida bunday qadam yo‘q."

